(text "MCU. STM32H743VIT6 LQFP-100. HSE 25MHz, LSE 32.768kHz. SWD header + JP1 (CM5 can reflash MCU over SWD).\nPeripherals: SPI4 slave to CM5, USART2 to CM5, FDCAN1/2, USART3 RS-485, I2C1 (expanders/ADC/FRAM), SPI1 to ADE9000s via isolators." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9462485c-4cc4-471d-be58-2013d8c20893"))
